quiz:[
 {t:"mc",q:"___, the proposal is costly; yet the long-term savings are undeniable.",o:["Granted","Provided","Despite","Unless"],a:0},
 {t:"mc",q:"We'd be prepared to offer free delivery, provided that you ___ at least 500 units.",o:["will order","order","would order","ordering"],a:1},
 {t:"mc",q:"I wonder if you ___ consider a different approach to the client.",o:["might","must","shall","will to"],a:0},
 {t:"mc",q:"I'm conscious of the time. Can we ___ that issue and circle back to it later?",o:["park","chair","digress","recap"],a:0},
 {t:"mc",q:"Please accept our sincere apologies for the ___ caused.",o:["molestation","inconvenience","oversight of","grievances to"],a:1},
 {t:"fill",q:"That argument doesn't hold ___. (no se sostiene)",ans:["water"]},
 {t:"listen",say:"We could consider a five percent discount, on condition that the contract is extended to three years. That said, the delivery schedule is non-negotiable.",q:"¿Qué es lo que NO se puede negociar?",o:["El descuento","La duración del contrato","El calendario de entregas","El precio base"],a:2},
 {t:"listen",say:"So, to recap, we've agreed to postpone the launch until April. Luis will follow up with the agency, and I'll circulate the minutes tomorrow morning.",q:"¿Quién enviará el acta?",o:["Luis","La agencia","La persona que preside la reunión","Nadie"],a:2},
 {t:"write",q:"Escribe un texto (mínimo 140 palabras) en el que, como jefe de proyecto, respondes a un colega que rechaza tu propuesta en una reunión: concede uno de sus puntos, refuta otro, propone una concesión condicional para llegar a un acuerdo y cierra resumiendo los siguientes pasos.",min:140,keys:[["i take your point","granted","admittedly","i can see where"],["yet","that said","even so","doesn't hold water","does not hold water"],["provided that","as long as","on condition that","prepared to"],["to recap","action items","follow up","next steps"]]},
 {t:"oral",text:"I take your point, but that argument doesn't quite hold water."},
 {t:"oral",text:"As a goodwill gesture, we'd like to offer you a full refund."}
],
